## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Default Penetration (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when repeated stuns or slows stop Lunox from choosing Brilliance or Darkening on time.; Glowing Wand over Genius Wand when Use against Estes, Floryn, Ruby, Esmeralda, or shield-heavy drafts where Lifebane matters more than early Magic Defense shred.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use against hard dive that can force Brilliance first, then kill Lunox as soon as the invulnerability ends.
- Total cost: 11830 gold

Default mid setup that fixes mana and rotation tempo first, then turns Lunox's Chaos window into reliable penetration damage.

### Frontline Sustain DPS (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Concentrated Energy, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Concentrated Energy
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Holy Crystal over Blood Wings when Use when the enemy front line cannot instantly punish Lunox and the game needs faster carry kills.; Queen's Wings over Blood Wings when Use when extended brawls drop Lunox low before she can finish a Chaos chain.; Athena's Shield over Blood Wings when Use against one-shot magic engage where surviving the first spell cycle matters more than a final damage slot.
- Total cost: 10900 gold

Sustain build for bruiser-heavy games where Lunox must kite the first target, convert spell vamp pressure into Chaos damage, and avoid CC lockout.

### Jungle Chaos Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Genius Wand, Concentrated Energy, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Genius Wand, Concentrated Energy
- Emblem: Basic Common Emblem with Thrill, Seasoned Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Blood Wings over Holy Crystal when Use when river fights are decided by whether Lunox survives after blinking in with Darkening.; Wishing Lantern over Holy Crystal when Use when the enemy stacks HP and Lunox can repeatedly hit the same frontliner during Lord setups.; Magic Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when your team already has Magic Defense shred and Lunox needs faster form cycling around objectives.
- Total cost: 11750 gold

Jungle setup for coordinated drafts that give Lunox early cover, objective access, and enough peel to spend Darkening as a damage window instead of an escape.

